body:
Some functions in tokio, such as [block_in_place()](https://docs.rs/tokio/1.21.2/tokio/task/fn.block_in_place.html), only work in a multi-threaded runtime. It would be great to be able to inspect the current configuration/flavor of the runtime so that we can conditionally call such functions, e.g.:

```
if Handle::current().is_multi_threaded() {
    block_in_place(move || { long_running_code(...) })
} else {
    long_running_code(...)
}
```
